@testray.main.component.name = "Support QA"
@type = "sites"

Feature: Contracts Landing Pages
	API testing for cheking a contracts landing page

Setup:
	* I get all contractual links

Scenario: Cheking Okta Site
    Link should be up and running.

    Given I should be able to view the "${oktaURL}" page

Scenario: Cheking RabbitMQ Site
    Link should be up and running.

    Given I should be able to view the "${rabbitmqURL}" page

Scenario: Cheking Customer Site
    Link should be up and running.

    Given I should be able to view the "${customerURL}" page

Scenario: Cheking Koroneiki Site
    Link should be up and running.

    Given I should be able to view the "${koroneikiURL}" page

Scenario: Cheking Provisioning Site
    Link should be up and running.

    Given I should be able to view the "${provisioningURL}" page

Scenario: Cheking Zendesk Site
    Link should be up and running.

    Given I should be able to view the "${zendeskURL}" page

Scenario: Cheking Issues Zendesk Site
    Link should be up and running.

    Given I should be able to view the "${issuesZenURL}" page


